SQLite is in the Public Domain.

The SQLite source code, from which this WebAssembly build is produced, is
dedicated to the public domain by its authors:

    https://sqlite.org/copyright.html

The npm packaging of this build (@sqlite.org/sqlite-wasm) declares Apache-2.0
in its package metadata. Either way the terms are compatible with UMSH's own
Apache-2.0 / MIT dual license.
